# Point (degenerate-interval) Markov chain. Exact reachability by linear solve.
# 3 = target (absorbing), 2 = dead/sink (absorbing, non-target).
#   s0 -> s1 (0.5), s2 (0.5);   s1 -> s3 (0.5), s2 (0.5)
# P(reach {3}): p3=1, p2=0, p1=0.5, p0=0.25.
# Point MDP => PRISM / Storm / IntervalMDP.jl give exactly these (no interval slack).
states 4
init 0
label target 3
tran 0 0  1:0.5:0.5 2:0.5:0.5
tran 1 0  3:0.5:0.5 2:0.5:0.5
tran 2 0  2:1:1
tran 3 0  3:1:1
